    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28052" root="عثم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثْمٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of 1 [q. v.]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُبِرَتْ يَدُهُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى عَثْمٍ</span> means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى عُقْدَةٍ</span>, (S and O in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عقد</span>,)
[i. e. <i>His arm was set and joined unevenly,</i>] <i>so as
to form a node,</i> or <i>protuberance, like a swelling,
not so hard as bone.</i> (ISk, L in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجر</span>.)

